\code{\link[=design_systematic]{design_systematic()}}; the rebuild is refused.

A row with a missing id, an id that appears twice in \code{data}, an id that
\code{frame} does not have or holds more than once, and a row the design gives a
probability of 0 are refused, with the ids named.
